        "text": "You can now treat two moving objects as one changing gap.\n\nToward each other means add speeds. Same direction means subtract. At a meeting, equal time makes travelled distances follow the speed ratio.\n\nNext, we specialise that idea for pursuits: delayed starts, chases and overtaking.",
